# {{projectName}} - Built with Nutin

## Development

Requires Node.js 24 or later.

{{#if extension}}
- `{{packageManager}} run build`: build the extension into `dist/chrome` and `dist/firefox`, then reload it in the browser (load it once: **Load unpacked** in `chrome://extensions`, **Load Temporary Add-on…** in Firefox's `about:debugging`)
{{else}}
- `{{packageManager}} run serve`: build and serve
- `{{packageManager}} run dev`: build and serve with live reload
- Both serve on port 9090 by default. Pass `-- --port 3000` (or set `PORT=3000`) to change it
{{/if}}

## Build

- `{{packageManager}} run build`: build the application
- `{{packageManager}} run build:prod`: build the application for production
{{#if (eq lang "ts")}}
- `{{packageManager}} run typecheck`: type-check the application without building it
{{/if}}
{{#if extension}}
- `{{packageManager}} run package:extension`: prod build, then the store ZIPs (`dist/<name>-<browser>-<version>.zip`)
- `{{packageManager}} run validate:extension`: check the ZIPs before a release
- `{{packageManager}} run lint:extension`: run Mozilla's `web-ext lint` on `dist/firefox`
{{/if}}

